# Line-ending policy for ContentGuard.
#
# The repo is edited from two environments on one working tree:
#   - WSL (Linux git, /mnt/d/... , core.autocrlf defaults to false)
#   - Windows (Git for Windows, system config sets core.autocrlf=true)
# Without an explicit policy, a Windows-side edit can rewrite a whole file to CRLF
# and produce a full-file diff. Normalize to LF everywhere instead.
#
# Paired setting (already applied at repo level): core.autocrlf=false
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never convert binary artifacts.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.ico binary
